OL,3,GNEWSAHouse of Keys election contested
OL,4,Aby 82 candidates
OL,5,
OL,6,FA total of 82 candidates will be
OL,7,Fcontesting the general election in the
OL,8,FIsle of Man.
OL,10,FThe poll to elect members of the House
OL,11,Fof Keys, known as MHKs, takes place on
OL,12,F24 September.
OL,14,FVoters in each of the 12 constituencies
OL,15,Fwill each elect two representatives to
OL,16,Fserve in the Manx parliament for the
OL,17,Fnext five years.
OL,19,FConfirmed candidates have been backed
OL,20,Fby a proposer, a seconder and 20 people
OL,21,Fon the electoral register in the area.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
